<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <title>贵客万象</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;600&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --paper: #f4ecd8;
      --ink: #2b2a26;
      --ink-mute: #8a8578;
      --mount: #5d7869;
      --seal: #a4432a;
      --stage: #1a1a19;
      --serif-cn: "Noto Serif SC", "Songti SC", "STSong", serif;
      --serif-en: "Cormorant Garamond", "Times New Roman", serif;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--stage);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--serif-cn);
    }
    .stage {
      min-height: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: stretch;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .phone {
      position: relative;
      height: 100vh;
      width: calc(100vh * 9 / 16);
      max-width: 100vw;
      background: var(--paper);
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 48px 36px 40px;
    }
    .phone::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.35), transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(140% 100% at 50% 100%, rgba(120,100,60,0.18), transparent 60%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .top, .mid, .foot { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .brand {
      letter-spacing: 0.42em;
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink-mute);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .seal {
      position: absolute;
      top: 44px;
      right: 32px;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--seal);
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: var(--seal);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: 44px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--seal);
      padding-left: 16px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }
    p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4a4740;
    }
    .foot {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--mount);
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="stage">
    <main class="phone">
      <div class="top">
        <div class="brand">Guizhou</div>
        <div class="seal">象</div>
      </div>
      <div class="mid">
        <h1>贵客万象</h1>
        <p>把贵州特色按兴趣推给客人，<br>替文旅把人送到此刻还不挤的地方。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="foot">贵客未行，万象先启</div>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
